      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DR. GIANNA (2) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last four starts, the latest when second (24.95) at this track. Overdue and expected to feature again. CATCH A CUTIE (4) hit the ground running from out wide and on speed early but faded and swamped late when 7th at this track in Grade 5 company. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. WARRIOR TOMMY (7) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing third (23.46) at Warragul in a Grade 5 over 400m. The form from his last run stacks up well. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. SMOOTH TIGER (8) can run a bold race on best form.",
